# Wikidata P2370 (conversion to SI unit) for the units grounded in
# data/seed/meanings-units.lino, captured 2026-10-07 from the wbgetentities
# API (issue #1176 R1). Each row keeps the unit's seed slug, its Wikidata
# item, the stated amount and the unit item it converts to, with that unit's
# seed slug. Rows whose target is not itself a grounded unit, and identity
# rows, are left out.
#
# This is a source capture, not hand-typed data: both runtimes read it at
# answer time (rust/src/solver_handlers/unit_conversion.rs and
# js/worker/formal_ai_worker_units.js), resolve each unit of a linear
# conversion to its item here, derive the factor from the two stated
# amounts, and cite the items and the property in the answer.
# rust/tests/unit/issue_1176_quantities_dates.rs also checks the si_factor
# column of data/seed/si-unit-dimensions.lino against it. Refresh with
# `node scripts/refresh-wikidata-conversion-to-si.mjs --write`.
